# no comment is the tag of that release, the others are lines of the
# "## incompatible changes" section of the report of gorelease. make
# verify-go-api prints the whole report and fails as usual, unless it compares
# with that tag, gorelease found no errors or diagnostics and every
# incompatible change it reports is one of the lines below. Once the next
# release got tagged, gorelease compares with that one, the file is a no-op
